Package: luxand-service
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: default-jre (>= 2:1.25) | openjdk-25-jre | temurin-25-jre
Maintainer: Verification Portal <ops@example.com>
Description: Server-side face matching daemon for the Verification Portal
 Wraps Luxand FaceSDK 8.3 behind a localhost JSON API on port 8040.
 Runs as a systemd unit on the central EC2 server. The portal backend
 forwards captured webcam JPEGs through this service and stores the
 1:1 similarity score on the verification audit row. Operator laptops
 do not run this service — face matching is centralized.
